' Scope: PlantUML version of component.md, drawn from docker-compose.yml, gateway/nginx.conf and the service
' entry points on main @ fcd5371. Shows what is built; no rationale. Legend and arrow styles added so control
' flow (requests) and data flow (reads/writes) can be told apart.
